Suggested-by: Dave Hansen <dave.hansen@linux.intel.com>
Suggested-by: K Prateek Nayak <kprateek.nayak@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Ackerley Tng <ackerleytng@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Ashish Kalra <ashish.kalra@amd.com>
